{"version":3,"kind":"Article","sha256":"261faeaf63d97ab227177881b1c91f3e1a928395f0277098c721bc0b0bf8d6c2","slug":"index","location":"/index.md","dependencies":[],"frontmatter":{"title":"Content-Addressed Caching for Reactive Notebooks","subtitle":"A System for Cell-Level Cache Reuse in marimo","venue":{"title":"SciPy 2026","url":"https://www.scipy2026.scipy.org/"},"authors":[{"nameParsed":{"literal":"Dylan Madisetti","given":"Dylan","family":"Madisetti"},"name":"Dylan Madisetti","orcid":"0000-0003-1269-4989","corresponding":true,"email":"dylan@marimo.io","affiliations":["marimo"],"id":"contributors-index-generated-uid-0"},{"nameParsed":{"literal":"Myles Scolnick","given":"Myles","family":"Scolnick"},"name":"Myles Scolnick","email":"myles@marimo.io","affiliations":["marimo"],"id":"contributors-index-generated-uid-1"},{"nameParsed":{"literal":"Akshay Agrawal","given":"Akshay","family":"Agrawal"},"name":"Akshay Agrawal","email":"akshay@marimo.io","affiliations":["marimo"],"id":"contributors-index-generated-uid-2"}],"affiliations":[{"id":"marimo","name":"marimo"}],"open_access":true,"license":{"content":{"id":"CC-BY-4.0","url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/","name":"Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International","free":true,"CC":true}},"downloads":[{"title":"Paper (PDF)","url":"/scipy_proceedings/build/paper-7b5b2b6700df4b4466a6a53e2c81ed77.pdf","filename":"paper.pdf","format":"pdf","static":true},{"title":"Notebook source (main.md)","url":"/scipy_proceedings/build/main-badcb8c223b2cd4214d698013e914286.md","filename":"main.md","format":"md","static":true}],"thumbnail":"/scipy_proceedings/build/fig1_dispatch-55a5192d601addb0e5d37660747e0783.png","exports":[{"format":"md","filename":"index.md","url":"/scipy_proceedings/build/index-5ebe9e642c6394bb56aa7620ef646062.md"}]},"mdast":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"block","position":{"start":{"line":31,"column":1},"end":{"line":31,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"include","file":"_abstract.md","literal":false,"lang":"markdown","children":[{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":6,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"We describe the caching mechanism behind resumable sessions in marimo, a reactive Python notebook.\nCache keys are derived recursively from the reactive DAG: references are content-addressed where their bytes are reachable, and the producing cell’s key is substituted where they are not, a Merkle-style recurrence that an edit invalidates at exactly the subtree it dominates.\nKeys are computed over compiled bytecode rather than source text, and the notebook that builds this paper re-derives the resulting invariances — to comments, formatting, cell reordering, and cell identifiers — against the implementation on every render.\nThe same keys make results durable and portable: cached values cross process and session boundaries through a lazy stub mechanism and ship inside marimo’s static WASM/HTML export, so a reader’s browser rehydrates results — even values produced by libraries the browser cannot import — with no local Python installation.\nMicrobenchmarks against representative baselines validate that the overhead stays interactive-class: hits on exploratory-scale payloads remain under the 100 ms threshold, and measuring the write path yields a break-even rule for when caching pays.\nThe mechanism stays native to the reactive notebook and requires no per-call-site opt-in.","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"key":"in5qkuqRW6"}],"key":"I4i9JLRsKe"}],"key":"a2xkIM2CFZ"}],"data":{"part":"abstract"},"key":"lxSAdWWp5T"},{"type":"block","position":{"start":{"line":36,"column":1},"end":{"line":36,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":38,"column":1},"end":{"line":38,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Read it your way","position":{"start":{"line":38,"column":1},"end":{"line":38,"column":1}},"key":"KFEmMZYd4b"}],"identifier":"read-it-your-way","label":"Read it your way","html_id":"read-it-your-way","implicit":true,"key":"vNMFf9Wlye"},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"spread":false,"position":{"start":{"line":40,"column":1},"end":{"line":44,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"listItem","spread":true,"position":{"start":{"line":40,"column":1},"end":{"line":40,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","position":{"start":{"line":40,"column":1},"end":{"line":40,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"link","url":"/paper","position":{"start":{"line":40,"column":1},"end":{"line":40,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"The paper, live","position":{"start":{"line":40,"column":1},"end":{"line":40,"column":1}},"key":"sRN70I5MjC"}],"urlSource":"./paper.md","dataUrl":"/paper.json","internal":true,"protocol":"file","key":"vfGxWCgf5C"}],"key":"WGhgl49hLn"},{"type":"text","value":" — the same notebook that builds the PDF, rendered with reactive marimo cells: drag the seed slider and watch the cache keys re-derive in your browser.","position":{"start":{"line":40,"column":1},"end":{"line":40,"column":1}},"key":"JToZ00UxwW"}],"key":"kcdFQo83q8"}],"key":"ZKISaxZhUi"},{"type":"listItem","spread":true,"position":{"start":{"line":41,"column":1},"end":{"line":41,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","position":{"start":{"line":41,"column":1},"end":{"line":41,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"link","url":"/scipy_proceedings/build/paper-7b5b2b6700df4b4466a6a53e2c81ed77.pdf","position":{"start":{"line":41,"column":1},"end":{"line":41,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Paper (PDF)","position":{"start":{"line":41,"column":1},"end":{"line":41,"column":1}},"key":"b1mXt3ML95"}],"urlSource":"./paper.pdf","static":true,"protocol":"file","key":"YSQIc6mIx6"}],"key":"cfdPDBvelZ"},{"type":"text","value":" — the typeset proceedings version.","position":{"start":{"line":41,"column":1},"end":{"line":41,"column":1}},"key":"zo4Auznzeo"}],"key":"MhK